    <string name="share_regenerate_confirm">Replace the username, password and port? Devices set up with the old ones will stop working through the phone.</string>
    <string name="share_limits">Good to know</string>
    <string name="share_limits_text">• The other device needs an app that supports a proxy. A SOCKS5 client with a password is the most reliable. The HTTP proxy in Wi-Fi settings does not pass the password: the browser will ask for it, other apps may not work.\n• This is not a VPN for the whole other device: only what goes through the proxy uses the tunnel, DNS included.\n• Routing and blocking are the same as on the phone; per-app rules do not apply to other devices.\n• While sharing is on, apps on this phone and devices on the hotspot can see an open port, a sign that a proxy is running. Turn sharing off when you do not need it.</string>
