    <string name="about_privacy_text">DPpass has no telemetry, analytics or crash reports and doesn’t read device identifiers. Subscriptions get only their link, DPpass’s own User-Agent and — if you turn it on — a random device ID. Network check (only when you tap it) contacts ya.ru, speed.cloudflare.com and www.google.com and sends nothing about you. The log and report stay on the phone.</string>
