    <string name="netcheck_title">Network check</string>
    <string name="netcheck_settings_note">What the network lets through right now</string>
    <string name="netcheck_intro">DPpass checks, one at a time, what this network lets through: names, connections, secure connections, QUIC and a large transfer — to ya.ru, speed.cloudflare.com and www.google.com, past the tunnel. Nothing about you or the phone is sent; these sites see the phone’s address, as when opening a page.</string>
    <string name="netcheck_note">For your information only: the result doesn’t change how a server is chosen yet. Repeated checks are paced — skipped steps are not network failures.</string>
